So, in my brief time playing Nethack (about 3 weeks) I've turned into a 
very frustrated player.  I never seem to be able to last for very long 
before being killed in a gruesome manner.

So, last night I started a new game... I decided to try out Wizard.  I 
let the computer randomly pick everything else and ended up being an 
Orcish Male Wizard.  So, I start off well.  I have a Scroll of Identify 
and a Scroll of Taming right off the bat.  Shortly after that, I stumble 
across a tin of floating eye meat and a blindfold.  (Not at the same 
time, though.)  So, now I have the advantage of knowing where everything 
is when I wear my blindfold.  So, the first question is:  How long does 
Telepathy last?  I've probably had it for at least 150 turns so far. 
(That's just a guess, though.)

I learned the hard way to not explore dungeons with the blindfold on, 
and fell through a trap, which separated me from my pet.  (Which is a 
bad thing)  Currently, I'm searching for the stairs up to get back to my 
pet.  (Assuming she doesn't die while I'm gone.)  If she does, I'll be 
sad... but at least I have that handy (blessed) Scroll of Taming to get 
a new pet.  So, my second question is:  What sorts of creatures will a 
scroll of taming work on?

Finally, I've been having a horrible time trying to find food.  I've 
eaten a monkey corpse (ew!), that tin of eye meat and that's about it. 
I've prayed twice to keep from dying of hunger.  I know it's safe to eat 
anything you see your pet eat, but no corpses have been turning up 
recently.  My third question is: How ofen can I pray before my God says, 
"Enough already!  No more free stomach filling for you!" ?
(ie, does Prayer stop working at any point?)

Finally, what exactly does a Ring of Warning do?  I'm wearing one (I'm 
not sure where it came from.  I think I may've started with it.) and it 
doesn't seem to be warning me about anything.  This could be a good 
thing, actually.

Overall, I feel really positive about this character.  This seems to be 
my best run ever so far.  I have a nice selection of wands (Magic 
Missile, Striking, and one other who I forget right now.), a couple 
potions, decent armor.  (Cloak of Magic Resistance +1, which is just 
making spells bounce off me.)  I'm xl 5 right now, on the 2nd level of 
the Gnomish Mines.  I'm under no delusions I'm going to ascend with this 
character... but if I could make it to Dungeon Level 8 or 9, I'd be happy.

I know I could probably find answers to all my questions in spoilers on 
the web, but I usually prefer to figure stuff out myself.  It's just 
that I know I'll end up reading all the spoilers if I check... and I 
still want to figure most stuff out on my own.

So, thanks for any answers you can give me on this!


